ooksmax.org/threads/hooded-hunter-eyes.1417994/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250513070332/https://looksmax.org/threads/hooded-hunter-eyes.1417994/"},{"title":"interplay of eyebrows and hunter eyes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/interplay-of-eyebrows-and-hunter-eyes.1343099/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250314121538/https://looksmax.org/threads/interplay-of-eyebrows-and-hunter-eyes.1343099/"},{"title":"psl gods with hunter eyes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-gods-with-hunter-eyes.1326686/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228011219/https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-gods-with-hunter-eyes.1326686/"},{"title":"how to get hunter eyes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/how-to-get-hunter-eyes.1257528/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250323005213/https://looksmax.org/threads/how-to-get-hunter-eyes.1257528/"},{"title":"how to get hunter eyes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/how-to-get-hunter-eyes.1226686/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250218120754/https://looksmax.org/threads/how-to-get-hunter-eyes.1226686/"},{"title":"what did he get for hunter eyes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/what-did-he-get-for-hunter-eyes.1169960/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20241003224759/https://looksmax.org/threads/what-did-he-get-for-hunter-eyes.1169960/"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"City Hunter: Shinjuku Private Eyes — Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/City_Hunter:_Shinjuku_Private_Eyes"},{"title":"Hunter eyes — Grokipedia","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Hunter_eyes"},{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing"},{"title":"Hunter eyes (Grokipedia)","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Hunter_eyes"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Eyes & eye area","chain":["Deep-set, lightly hooded eyes","Intense, masculine gaze","Striking eye area"],"effect":"claimed","text":"Hunter eyes are described online as an ideal eye area: a positive tilt, deep set and low brows that give an intense, masculine gaze. Users approximate it with grooming and makeup, and some try squinting or exercises. The term has no formal medical definition."},"wikipedia":{"title":"City Hunter: Shinjuku Private Eyes","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/City_Hunter:_Shinjuku_Private_Eyes"},"grokipedia":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Hunter_eyes","lead":["Hunter eyes is an informal looksmaxxing term for an eye area said to look intense and masculine. Descriptions generally include a positive canthal tilt, deep-set eyes, limited upper-eyelid exposure and low-set eyebrows.[1][2] The opposite is called 'prey eyes', described as rounder and showing more sclera with a negative tilt.[2]","Grokipedia states the term has no formal classification in medical, anthropological or ophthalmological literature, and that comparisons to predator and prey eyes come from animal research rather than human face studies.[2] Wikipedia lists hunter eyes among the community's core terms.[1]","Within looksmax.org there is a long-running split. Some users call hunter eyes a signature of appeal, others dispute the value of the concept or argue it is determined by bone structure that exercise cannot change.[3][4][5]"],"infobox":[["Type","Looksmaxxing slang for an eye-area look"],["Typical features cited","Positive canthal tilt, deep-set, low brow, minimal upper-lid show"],["Opposite term","Prey eyes"],["Medical recognition","None as a category"],["Related","Canthal tilt, orbital vector, hooded eyes"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Wikipedia's looksmaxxing article summarizes hunter eyes as a positive canthal tilt with little upper-eyelid exposure and low-set eyebrows.[1] Grokipedia adds deep-set, almond-like shape and a piercing gaze, and notes forums describe it as part of an idealized 'Chad' look.[2]","Forum users distinguish hunter eyes from simply 'good' eyes. One looksmax.org thread argues that a good eye area does not automatically mean hunter eyes, and another explains high-appeal eyes as those with attractive features but a slightly larger shape or recessed lower-lid support.[3][4]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Origins and spread","paras":["Grokipedia reports the term emerged from looksmaxxing, incel and blackpill forums in the 2010s and later spread on Reddit and TikTok.[2] Older looksmax.org threads on the subject date from the platform's early years, with titles ranging from praise to dismissal.[6]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Methods discussed","paras":["Community and encyclopedic sources describe makeup and lash techniques, squinting, facial exercises, mewing, and surgery such as canthoplasty or upper blepharoplasty. Grokipedia says evidence for mewing and exercises is weak or lacking.[2] On looksmax.org one user asks how to correct 'hunter eyes training' asymmetry and gets replies that no exercise changes eye shape because it is set by bone structure.[5]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]},{"h":"In looksmaxxing culture","paras":["Threads argue both that hunter eyes are highly desirable and that they are overrated or look unusual.[3][4] Critics outside the forums, summarized by Grokipedia, link the trend to body-image anxiety and to Eurocentric beauty standards.[2]"],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Hunter eyes is a staple of looksmax.org eye-area discussion, with sharply divided opinions.[3][4][5]","claims":[{"claim":"Hunter eyes are a top-tier attractive trait.","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Hunter eyes can be trained with exercises or squinting.","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Hunter eyes are overrated or a meme.","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Hunter eyes (Grokipedia)","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Hunter_eyes","source":"Grokipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"HUNTER EYES DONT MATTER","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes-dont-matter.1790210/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Hunter eyes are appeal and psl","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes-are-appeal-and-psl.1787922/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Hunter eyes. My right eye has an problem.","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes-my-right-eye-has-an-problem.1767136/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Hunter eyes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes.493346/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2020,"type":"forum"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"HUNTER EYES DONT MATTER","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes-dont-matter.1790210/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228181307/https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes-dont-matter.1790210/"},{"title":"Hunter eyes are appeal and psl","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes-are-appeal-and-psl.1787922/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251227164452/https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes-are-appeal-and-psl.1787922/"},{"title":"Hunter eyes. My right eye has an problem.","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes-my-right-eye-has-an-problem.1767136/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251218052243/https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes-my-right-eye-has-an-problem.1767136/"},{"title":"hunter eyes big cope","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes-big-cope.1709915/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251227151108/https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes-big-cope.1709915/"},{"title":"hunter eyes surgery result","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hunter-eyes-surgery-result.626953/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/2023110406555